This repository holds two apps by the same owner: B2B Exam Prep (the repository root) and Board Ready (the
boardready/ folder). Both, including their code, design, lessons, questions, answers, primers, pictures, games and
documentation, are owned by SFC Rabin Napit. The repository is public so that the apps can be published free of
charge. That does not make them open source, and no license to the code or content is granted except as written
below.

You may:
- use the apps at https://rabinnapit.github.io/51C/ and https://rabinnapit.github.io/51C/boardready/ free of charge
  for your own study, and Board Ready also to run your unit's study group, mock boards or a review board;
- share those links or their QR codes, or pass on an unchanged copy of an app file or its Word package, for other
  people's own study;
- in Board Ready, fix or add questions with the app's own content editor and share that copy inside your unit;
- view this repository on GitHub. Forking it on GitHub, which GitHub's terms allow, gives no right to use,
  change or publish the code or content anywhere else.

You may not, without the owner's written permission:
- copy, change, translate or adapt the code or the content;
- put any part of it into another app, website, course or product;
- host a copy anywhere else;
- sell it or charge for access to it;
- remove the owner's name, this notice or an app's terms of use.

Not covered by this notice: public works of the U.S. Government shown or drawn on in the apps (regulations, policy
documents, official documents, forms and Army study lists) stay in the public domain, and the fonts embedded in
